# UI standards

- Stay in the premium direction: glass nav, atmospheric stages, serif moments, large rounded chapters, human photos, generous space.
- Refine inside that direction. Do not throw it away for a totally different theme.
- Content must be Linken (partners, confirmation, case studies) — not AI-platform copy.
- Fonts: Newsreader + Plus Jakarta Sans.
- Every major section should feel like its own premium composition.
